.com/news/2026/07/15/lake-hazel-road-extension-build-grant/","author":["[[Sydney Kidd - BoiseDev Reporter]]"],"published":"2026-07-23","created":"2026-07-24","description":"A major roadway project south of the Boise Airport is now much closer to becoming reality thanks to federal dollars. The City of Boise was recently awarded a $5.6 million federal Better Utilizing Investments to Leverage Development grant to go toward the Lake Hazel Rd. extension.  The Lake Hazel Rd. extension would connect Southwest Boise […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},